**Table 2: Summary tables of evaluation results.**

| Analysis               | PPL    | Total Programs | Warnings produced  |
| ---------------------- | ------ | -------------: | ----------------:  |
| Dependency Analysis    | Turing |            117 |                 6  |
| Dependency Analysis    | PyMC   |             97 |                 2  |
